 Cooperation Process

1. Requirement discussion → feature list / quote / schedule
2. Prototype and solution → confirm pages / interactions / APIs
3. Development and integration → progress updates and demo versions during the cycle
4. Launch delivery → deployment, documentation, training, and after-sales maintenance





